  "business_rules": [
    "Deleted records (is_deleted = 1) should normally be excluded from reporting.",
    "Approval state is tracked with is_approved; a record with neither flag set is typically still pending.",
    "created_date is the preferred date column for period-based reporting.",
    "Join to Client, Crm Client Type, Users through the foreign key columns to resolve names."
